  "name": "Extended Executive",
  "description": "The extended executive block function code defines variables that affect module operations. Function code 90 sets system operation characteristics for modules. Use function code 90 with function codes 81 (executive) and 82 (segment control) to define module operations. Function code 90 resides in fixed block 20 and occupies ten function blocks (20 through 29).",
